dsh-plugin-installer README · Windows（普通 cmd 即可）：mklink /J "%USERPROFILE%\.dsh\profiles\<profile>\node_modules\dsh-plugin-installer" "<你的工作区>\DSH-Plugin\dsh-plugin-installer"
```

3) 改 `<profile>/package.json` 两处，然后**完全退出并重启 DSH**：

```jsonc
{
  "dependencies": {
    "dsh-plugin-installer": "link:<你的工作区>/DSH-Plugin/dsh-plugin-installer"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "profile": {
      "bundles": [ /* …原有条目…, "dsh-plugin-installer" */ ]
    }
  }
}
```

重启后左侧栏出现「插件安装」图标（方块里带向下箭头）即成功。

dsh-plugin-installer README · Pitfall B: pnpm buries `@deepseek-ai/dsh-tools` in the profile：* Scan once at startup; if found, move it into `.tools/backups/dsh-tools-stale-*` (same handling as `dsh_doctor.py --fix`);
* **After every pnpm run** (post-install, post-rollback), scan again;
* If it was ever found, leave a traceable yellow banner at the top of the panel with a "check again" button.

Manual fallback: `host_selfcheck({plugin:"dsh-plugin-installer", script:"dev/quarantine-dshtools.mjs"})`
or `python .tools/dsh_doctor.py --fix`.

